---
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/layout.css";
import "../styles/components.css";
import "../styles/responsive.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Us | Convertly</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn about Convertly, a modern USD to INR converter built for fast, accurate, and mobile-friendly exchange-rate calculations."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fafafa" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0a" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://convertly.app/about" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="legal-page">
      <div class="legal-shell">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to converter</a>
        <article class="legal-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
          <h1>About Convertly</h1>
          <p>
            Convertly is a modern USD to INR converter designed for clarity, speed, and trust. We help
            users check live USD to INR exchange rates, compare historical data, and convert values
            quickly and accurately.
          </p>
          <p>
            Our focus is simple: provide a clean and fast financial utility that works on desktop and
            mobile. We use live market data from trusted public exchange-rate sources to ensure the
            calculator remains up to date.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether you are checking 1 USD to INR, 100 USD to INR, 500 USD to INR, the current USD to
            INR rate, or USD to INR live updates, Convertly is designed to answer those questions in
            seconds.
          </p>
          <p>
            We believe financial tools should be efficient, transparent, and easy to understand. That
            is why we keep the interface minimal, the rate information clear, and the experience
            distraction-free.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
